{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《美食新聞報道》帶領觀眾走訪三區，由地道南洋風味、日式平民食堂，一路品嚐到充滿創意的新派糕點。今次為大家整理出三大必食餐廳推介，無論是想吃飽足正餐還是精緻甜點，都能滿足你的味蕾！</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">首站由張與辰帶領行仔來到旺角一間充滿南洋風情的茶餐室，品嚐地道馬來西亞菜式並親身體驗拉茶文化。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>餐廳資料：</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>店名</strong>：蘇媽.蘇媽馬來西亞茶餐室</p></li><li></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"11423c71-4cbf-4d33-9e6d-dd56d4150fe2.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026uYiFbRhh261790737464.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"11423c71-4cbf-4d33-9e6d-dd56d4150fe2.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e42cb4b9-f1f9-4f4a-b27b-d2de3c3abb54.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026EaxvvzPOnj1790737464.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e42cb4b9-f1f9-4f4a-b27b-d2de3c3abb54.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e70ff79a-69e7-4981-9b34-0ccb4fb72da1.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026KUZhNPYpqq1790737469.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e70ff79a-69e7-4981-9b34-0ccb4fb72da1.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"6370e2c8-673e-4ef0-9ea0-f61e660e67b8.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026qGXB96FlFw1790737468.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"6370e2c8-673e-4ef0-9ea0-f61e660e67b8.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3ea05c03-6f20-454a-a8a6-4591e76e250b.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026UsY6IWtZFI1790737468.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3ea05c03-6f20-454a-a8a6-4591e76e250b.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">第二站由伍倩彤與葉靖儀發掘一間由小巷搬至大街的平民人氣日式隱世食堂。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>餐廳資料：</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>店名</strong>：一笑食堂</p></li><li></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ba37c9f2-83a1-466d-8fd2-3f33e94b5772.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026F0uC0PR7ju1790737467.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ba37c9f2-83a1-466d-8fd2-3f33e94b5772.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f8ec76d3-47fe-4e67-9f38-d3698963c948.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026ahmLChIGHY1790737467.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f8ec76d3-47fe-4e67-9f38-d3698963c948.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9baa8078-9a97-44fe-ba08-30672bc24cfe.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026eAmKkOOYli1790737466.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9baa8078-9a97-44fe-ba08-30672bc24cfe.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"490e4775-1442-445d-aae3-81d6f63f1e20.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20267ONUkocFEX1790737466.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"490e4775-1442-445d-aae3-81d6f63f1e20.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">壓軸一站，林映暉與波波（黃婧靈）來到銅鑼灣一間主打手作與新派特色的創意糕點店，品嚐多款結合中西元素的甜品。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>餐廳資料：</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>店名</strong>：糖小姐</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>地址</strong>：銅鑼灣謝斐道 518A 號地舖</p></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a7bf44b9-cfbf-4579-a8d8-4fcc3421e8cc.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026LXKV3r9VFq1790737465.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a7bf44b9-cfbf-4579-a8d8-4fcc3421e8cc.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f2c1c479-4cc1-4b9a-9d8b-0e0252236a07.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026eI4gaEEqi51790737465.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f2c1c479-4cc1-4b9a-9d8b-0e0252236a07.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1bb869c9-a5af-482c-bd3a-c14de68a43e5.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026tj9lMMUbzs1790737465.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1bb869c9-a5af-482c-bd3a-c14de68a43e5.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-01T14:40:00.884727+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":298,"images":12,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}